 ## 15\. Gemini Integration

 Gemini is used as the AI-processing component of EduGenie.

 A contextual prompt can contain information such as:

```
Role: Educational Assistant
Subject: Computer Science
Student Level: Beginner
Topic: Data Structures
Task: Explain binary search
Response Style: Simple and step-by-step
```

 The backend sends the request to Gemini and processes the returned response before displaying it to the student.

 The Gemini API credential should be stored securely on the server side and should not be exposed in frontend source code.

