## 20\. Security Considerations

 EduGenie should:

 - Hash passwords.
- Protect API credentials.
- Validate user input.
- Restrict access to authenticated resources.
- Protect user-specific learning records.
- Validate uploaded files.
- Use secure communication in production.
- Avoid exposing internal server errors.
- Avoid storing unnecessary personal information.

 ## 21\. Limitations

 The project has some limitations:

 - AI-generated responses may occasionally contain inaccurate information.
- Gemini availability depends on external API services.
- API usage may be subject to quotas and costs.
- Internet connectivity is required for AI features.
- AI responses may vary for similar prompts.
- Progress indicators represent application activity and should not be interpreted as comprehensive measures of academic achievement.

