 ## 25\. Conclusion

 **EduGenie: Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant** demonstrates the application of generative AI in education through an interactive learning platform. By combining a web-based interface, backend services, database management, and Google Gemini, the system provides students with on-demand educational assistance.

 The project emphasizes **personalized learning, interactive content generation, and convenient access to educational support**, while recognizing that AI-generated information should be reviewed and verified when accuracy is important.
